ór."]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["Czasem najlepsza rozmowa to brak rozmowy."]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[3,"Zapytaj wprost o zamek"]},{"code":111,"indent":2,"parameters":[2,"A",1]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["People3",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["*Borgar nagle poważnieje i unika Twojego wzroku*"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["...Zamek? Nie wiem, o czym mówisz. To tylko piwnica."]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Wiesz co... starzy w rodzinie zawsze mówili: nie pytaj o to, czego naprawdę nie chcesz wiedzieć."]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Może... może lepiej zostawmy to. Napij się czegoś."]},{"code":123,"indent":3,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":122,"indent":3,"parameters":[1,1,1,0,1]},{"code":411,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["People3",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Już ci mówiłem - to tylko piwnica."]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["...Naprawdę."]},{"code":412,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[4,"Sprzedaj towar"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["People3",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["Pokaż, co masz. Jak towar dobry, to i cena dobra."]},{"code":302,"indent":2,"parameters":[0,59,0,0,false]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[5,"To wszystko, dzięki"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["People3",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["Wracaj, kiedy zechcesz."]},{"code":113,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":413,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":4,"y":2},{"id":2,"name":"Melia Srebrogłosa","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"self